* DONJON5 RBMK Medium Test - 15x15x7
* Test IAEA-3D XS on medium RBMK-like geometry

LINKED_LIST RBMK RBMK_2 MACRO MACRO2 TRACK SYSTEM FLUX MATEX LMAP POWER FLMAP ;
MODULE GEO: MAC: TRIVAT: TRIVAA: FLUD: USPLIT: MACINI: RESINI: FLPOW: GREP: END: ;
REAL Keff ;
PROCEDURE assertS ;

*==============================================================
* GEOMETRY: 3D Cartesian core
*==============================================================
RBMK := GEO: :: CAR3D 15 15 7
          EDIT 2
          X- VOID  X+ VOID 
          Y- VOID  Y+ VOID 
          Z- VOID  Z+ VOID 
          
          MIX
